      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_present",
      "impact_statement": "The agent calls os.Root.Mkdir, MkdirAll and Chmod, but the flaw is in their Windows implementation, which follows an NTFS junction out of the root; the advisory scopes these symbols to GOOS=windows. The agent image is published for linux/amd64 and linux/arm64 only, whose build compiles a different implementation and does not include internal/syscall/windows."
